{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"歷代志下","commonName":"歷代志下","title":"歷代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"f440330757d9f7150b4f1ee6f00c3941c1130aecd7b039c9cd6c1d71a8c2f5d6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":818},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["建造聖殿"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所羅門在耶路撒冷的摩利亞山上動工興建耶和華的殿，殿址在耶布斯人阿珥楠的麥場，就是大衛指定的地方。耶和華曾在那裡向他父親大衛顯現。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["所羅門在執政第四年二月二日動工建殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["按照古時的尺度，他建造的上帝殿宇的地基長二十七米，寬九米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["殿前的門廊長九米，與殿的寬度一樣，高九米",{"noteId":1},"，裡面都貼上純金。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大殿裡鑲上松木板，貼上純金，又刻上棕樹和鏈子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所羅門用寶石和巴瓦音的純金裝飾聖殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["殿的棟梁、牆壁、門檻和門扇也都貼上金子；牆上還刻上基路伯天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所羅門又動工建造至聖所，長九米，寬九米，與殿的寬度一樣，裡面共貼了四十二萬兩純金。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["所用的金釘重十二兩。樓房也都貼上了金子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他又在至聖所製造兩個基路伯天使，包上金子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["兩個基路伯天使的翅膀共九米長，每個翅膀長兩米二。兩個基路伯天使面向殿站立，他們展開的翅膀共九米長，各有一個翅膀觸到殿牆，一個翅膀互相連接。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他用細麻和藍色、紫色、朱紅色毛線織成幔子，上面繡上基路伯天使。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["所羅門在殿前造了兩根柱子，每根高八米，上面的柱冠高兩米二。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他造了鏈子",{"noteId":2},"，裝飾在柱冠上。他又造了一百個石榴，安在鏈子上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他把兩根柱子一南一北立在殿前，南邊那根稱為雅斤，北邊那根稱為波阿斯。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「高九米」希伯來文是「高五十四米」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":4}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"「他造了鏈子」希伯來文是「他在聖所內造了鏈子」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}